#: scenario8:scenario8_538603F2_DF0F_4375_93D4_E9F2786EFA69
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6d42b5603cf0569e7970fb05cb552bddb94ae821a0464697e83688a5f05ccf7c
#. default-sha256: c6f1b3cced959573ee55abb19d05bc09313814631c7327019495244763014cfb
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_538603F2_DF0F_4375_93D4_E9F2786EFA69"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫When he takes the necklace, Jacopo looks as though he’s on the "
"verge of tears."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫首飾りを受け取った彼の顔は、⟪k:7⟫どこか、⟪k:8⟫泣き出しそうにも"
"見えた。⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫それでも一滴たりとも涙を流さなかったのは――"

#: scenario8:scenario8_B0BC1945_691B_4EF0_AC20_A025AC10EF48
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9ded436e531773c7788bab9964bdad2610afc94031b900a2b1975c2ea074185b
#. default-sha256: fbaa84c6b26efe8522f11121224043cd607886c9dd5ee1f952c8761e6e54ab42
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_B0BC1945_691B_4EF0_AC20_A025AC10EF48"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Whether from the pressure of not wanting to lose face, or simply because he’s no longer able "
"to, he doesn’t actually shed any, though."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫彼の中で、⟪k:1⟫まだ、⟪k:2⟫周囲の目というものが重く圧し掛かっていたからなのか――、⟪k:3⟫あるい"
"は、⟪k:4⟫もう涙は流せなくなっていたからなのか……。"

#: scenario8:scenario8_9DACE528_5CF3_410D_A06C_DFDBE77E8496
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d0180b53a16052bea781fd600e9bc7ec40f2bccccf5acdf7c5e1c1b9f4dac6ec
#. default-sha256: 2f789ccf2b26ab1cb7357bd7864c1ecf6211235c6740d9f1e4b1321c6367ce5a
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_9DACE528_5CF3_410D_A06C_DFDBE77E8496"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫The other two just stand and watch him quietly."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫他の二人は、⟪k:1⟫その様子を黙って見守っていた。⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫……ヤコポの過去を見たのは私だけだった"
"が――"

#: scenario8:scenario8_9E494A6D_9D0A_4A0A_B295_7EAC70594827
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 473e32496f3e0f50a5092ec4ed497c0f021ee1db116146d4c57696dd71ea6bff
#. default-sha256: 1a20aec96a4d48fd27917c986cce87e3d2195a5e0475e5736ef7e9f45a0fa9cc
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_9E494A6D_9D0A_4A0A_B295_7EAC70594827"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Neither of them saw the vision of his past, but they don’t pry either."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫その過去を聞き出そうとは、⟪k:1⟫しなかった。"

#: scenario8:scenario8_A65628ED_B3F4_4482_8AA8_AB8B6F5FBA83
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5189f012749d5b740115f19b6fe13ddd508ca97e6b460271ff10f16ac820c58e
#. default-sha256: 79def1c998fbc69cd2bb08591f6299ec5eb29ace54f618d0ed85450e3dc6fb93
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_A65628ED_B3F4_4482_8AA8_AB8B6F5FBA83"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Our exchange was probably sufficient to give them an idea of what happened, even if they "
"don’t know the details."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫彼の過去に何が起きたのか、⟪k:1⟫仔細には分からなかったとしても――⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫私と彼の言葉のやり取"
"りから、⟪k:4⟫伝わったものがあるのだろう。"

#: scenario8:scenario8_4331D23C_A965_432D_BF48_DCF3CB7E5BB4
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ab178f931e18a7a2ae17b415982e24a55b2dd5ed5776bcf31a16b6199bae1786
#. default-sha256: 509c0cb8b65ede9da82a0c2cdf157434bed9914c8a27d9de38a3bfe3cfee8f76
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_4331D23C_A965_432D_BF48_DCF3CB7E5BB4"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Clutching the necklace in one hand, Jacopo takes up the head of the procession to the "
"observation tower."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫ヤコポは首飾りを握り締めると、⟪k:1⟫我々を先導するように、⟪k:2⟫物見の塔へと向かい始めた。"

#: scenario8:scenario8_E1DFF7A8_FE7F_4E19_8D0A_6122F084BA4D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 120195d56ea021ed6014b0592dafabc38c05bffc800822d3ee01fa13e7aef451
#. default-sha256: 678f8b200df8eb9f6b74dbb9f8e6af19d8d54e9ce618871b417632f34a520a19
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_E1DFF7A8_FE7F_4E19_8D0A_6122F084BA4D"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫And while it lasts but for a brief moment,"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫一瞬ではあったけれど――"

#: scenario8:scenario8_C5189E0F_0867_4E32_95DB_CBC3BCFDF31D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ccaee4476be35175da76c5e12f96019e0f82c597bb7e5c058588e844837a54ca
#. default-sha256: 7b896140f52f41063aac7fcf6823d0b12fe4f1d89e9d5023117d878b6b2badf1
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_C5189E0F_0867_4E32_95DB_CBC3BCFDF31D"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I see an image of the young man he used to be in his slightly slouched shoulders."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫その背に、⟪k:1⟫かつての青年を、⟪k:2⟫私は重ねていた。"

#: scenario8:scenario8_EFE9D80D_62E2_4FAD_8C40_48885718C854
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b19b8dfa49588c9d4a3d9282a07a62dbbce74461c4282621c9e6f90c1d4cc101
#. default-sha256: 973011868fa18e99fd720d369e4d23be5dbdf7eb7787697d05ef96debb6b948e
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_EFE9D80D_62E2_4FAD_8C40_48885718C854"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫"
"⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫⟪k:20⟫⟪k:21⟫⟪k:22⟫⟪k:23⟫⟪k:24⟫⟪k:25⟫⟪k:26⟫⟪k:27⟫⟪k:28⟫⟪k:29⟫⟪k:30⟫⟪k:31⟫⟪k:32⟫They "
"each insert and turn their individual keys,"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫"
"⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫⟪k:20⟫⟪k:21⟫⟪k:22⟫⟪k:23⟫⟪k:24⟫⟪k:25⟫⟪k:26⟫⟪k:27⟫⟪k:28⟫⟪k:29⟫⟪k:30⟫⟪k:31⟫⟪k:32⟫それぞれ"
"の鍵が揃うと――"

#: scenario8:scenario8_78C4A1AD_06F0_404A_A911_289C2D1A8545
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a62343a9d81d9f025d95b319c69c178c132299d8b9ff2319795752024c7b6d0b
#. default-sha256: f6af41b35db8fdaa5cb78a68bc8aacc93cf951f86f42ea302a259f0146db806b
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_78C4A1AD_06F0_404A_A911_289C2D1A8545"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫the lock disengaging and the door giving a deep groan as it swings open."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫扉は、⟪k:1⟫重々しい音を響かせながら、⟪k:2⟫開いた。"

#: scenario8:scenario8_23F4E655_115E_47D8_81D4_32424412E816
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 775250e899fb854f7988e69b81d7877a83f42d08c1e26514d02392e54389a5d2
#. default-sha256: 5f882e4754e59400addf3b5a1abc0ebde60c62b91b3281b78aa7678e4973d2cf
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_23F4E655_115E_47D8_81D4_32424412E816"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Beyond it, a spiral staircase extends high into the sky."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫その奥には、⟪k:3⟫らせん階段が広がっている。"

#: scenario8:scenario8_039FE425_1400_4CF4_91E9_3587DDD3BA30
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b2193c4afccba31558071ed099bd6bacab8faa54914cbd5cc938d13395130562
#. default-sha256: 63d81cadf1772220c28fed2d401f6863f39e4e07a2bca68c4e4ba84e35f24550
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_039FE425_1400_4CF4_91E9_3587DDD3BA30"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Every time I’ve climbed these stairs, it’s always been a solemn affair—⟪k:1⟫and now is no "
"different."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫いつの時も、⟪k:1⟫この階段を上る瞬間は……胸に重いものを感じる。⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫この瞬間も、⟪k:4⟫例外"
"ではなかった。"

#: scenario8:scenario8_2940BC09_DF88_414F_83CD_7E63A3C23521
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c5a95029adc7a240b26888b824690c45b1ae30415deacaa5343c010d659a7fda
#. default-sha256: 259b2d9b8a85635d34302ce52440d6e027c0299023f7bb9281c7eb5bc953aedb
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_2940BC09_DF88_414F_83CD_7E63A3C23521"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I’ve succeeded, though. I’ve got them all here,⟪k:1⟫ready to set her free before she’s "
"supposed to die."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫けれど――、⟪k:1⟫モルガーナの死には、⟪k:2⟫間に合ったのだ。⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫彼女が死を迎えるのは明日の"
"正午――"

#: scenario8:scenario8_1A5A083C_156A_46D0_A0BC_EED6903904BE
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9277be3c704d936615f7fc698da87419faf6749ae62712355d14c08dc36607bf
#. default-sha256: 556519a688b8ecc7f3e54f8e9bb072474e7110687b0b73c297157aff110161b8
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_1A5A083C_156A_46D0_A0BC_EED6903904BE"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I have changed the past."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫私は――、⟪k:1⟫覆したのだ……。"

#: scenario8:scenario8_F9A6BD9D_1C88_4277_B45E_8C335670875A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 29fb83718b04fe103dd67be8af8af67469e47c0c7918ee78e302d24a11f766d8
#. default-sha256: dec6d9e56b3886964f9a4f5693b2e72b6510b6527c702113ecc857fbf757e64d
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_F9A6BD9D_1C88_4277_B45E_8C335670875A"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Giselle..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫……ジゼル……。"

#: scenario8:scenario8_33743BC5_AF6A_473E_8843_257470755545
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4f7d7ad544a94b05f29c67a6acf2e34ec81054f28170440b4ad72592e979cf29
#. default-sha256: ab67e345b0b034e9cb0f0c19a016e7541744d9b982852c721337ad80fc50c133
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_33743BC5_AF6A_473E_8843_257470755545"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Can you hear me, Giselle?⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫I made it in time..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫ジゼル、⟪k:2⟫聞いてくれ……。⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫私は間に合ったんだ……。"

#: scenario8:scenario8_4B81E828_6EC6_45D6_8382_0A7C6458FC9F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0ce9ae8a52a80160af44a6fd83b463bdddc5c9f45a48df4cd510e0b01af8b6a7
#. default-sha256: 202c403e0e05c9fccdfacf80d6009933374c54c091ffd3629b7ed226c71bf6df
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_4B81E828_6EC6_45D6_8382_0A7C6458FC9F"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Now Morgana doesn’t have to die tomorrow..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫……これでモルガーナを死なせることはない……。"

#: scenario8:scenario8_3A15591A_25A6_44B6_ADFF_A459432D8302
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9543ed396fa71aa940d5851d7116b490a94f55a9de0e03fbbcb8e290949ea944
#. default-sha256: cb35ecab111389d93f50673742f5c724451ee5ff4d72a60be4ecd8f705eefdc0
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_3A15591A_25A6_44B6_ADFF_A459432D8302"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫I did it..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫……間に合ったんだ……。"

#: scenario8:scenario8_B4D4045F_123A_4C55_8D4D_6D1CB19B18B5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 05866467b0700b7a1a47d65db6219b6afddefd5b93a1d563568859b21ba8a418
#. default-sha256: 33add5b5da4c7cbcae64cfa6a15f73e9bfb0b930be1ca82b131d3e933e468dd5
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_B4D4045F_123A_4C55_8D4D_6D1CB19B18B5"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Giselle..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫………ジゼル………。"

#: scenario8:scenario8_A1777F41_7073_474C_9003_CC2E9D520032
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 390a0ae43962c786170dc315bcf3900333f3912e7108baa7da1cad0f4629aa52
#. default-sha256: 9abf0fd48229e8cabeca53c5e78ab76c295081a81f91a7c165df5efbb44e9074
